<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-br">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>MÉTODO PRIME</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Orbitron:wght@700;900&family=Inter:wght@400;600;700;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>
    :root {
        --primary: #00c2ff;
        --primary-glow: rgba(0, 194, 255, 0.5);
        --success: #00ff88;
        --success-glow: rgba(0, 255, 136, 0.5);
        --gold: #ffd700;
        --bg: #030509;
        --card-bg: rgba(13, 19, 31, 0.75);
        --card-border: rgba(0, 194, 255, 0.15);
    }

    * {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        box-sizing: border-box;
        font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    }

    body {
        background: var(--bg);
        color: white;
        overflow-x: hidden;
        min-height: 100vh;
        position: relative;
    }

    body::before {
        content: "";
        position: fixed;
        inset: 0;
        background: 
            radial-gradient(circle at 50% 10%, rgba(0, 194, 255, 0.15), transparent 50%),
            radial-gradient(circle at 50% 80%, rgba(0, 255, 136, 0.08), transparent 50%);
        z-index: -1;
    }

    .container {
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 580px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 30px 16px 40px;
        text-align: center;
    }

    .main-card {
        background: var(--card-bg);
        border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
        border-radius: 28px;
        padding: 32px 20px;
        backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
        box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6), 0 0 30px rgba(0, 194, 255, 0.08);
    }

    .logo {
        font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;
        font-size: 40px;
        font-weight: 900;
        letter-spacing: 2px;
        margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .logo span {
        color: var(--primary);
        text-shadow: 0 0 20px var(--primary-glow);
    }

    .tagline-group {
        margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .tagline-main {
        font-size: 16px;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #e2e8f0;
    }

    .highlight-gold {
        color: var(--gold);
        font-weight: 900;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 1.5px;
        font-size: 14px;
        text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.3);
    }

    .no-pay-badge {
        background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(0, 255, 136, 0.15), rgba(0, 194, 255, 0.15));
        border: 1px solid var(--success);
        color: var(--success);
        padding: 12px 22px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        font-weight: 900;
        font-size: 13px;
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
        margin-bottom: 24px;
        box-shadow: 0 0 20px var(--success-glow);
        text-transform: uppercase;
        animation: pulseBadge 2.5s infinite ease-in-out;
    }

    @keyframes pulseBadge {
        0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); box-shadow: 0 0 20px var(--success-glow); }
        50% { transform: scale(1.03); box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(0, 255, 136, 0.6); }
    }

    .grid-pillars {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
        gap: 10px;
        margin-bottom: 26px;
    }

    .pillar-box {
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
        padding: 16px 8px;
        border-radius: 18px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
        font-size: 11px;
        font-weight: 800;
        transition: 0.3s;
    }

    .pillar-box:hover {
        border-color: var(--primary);
        background: rgba(0, 194, 255, 0.08);
    }

    .pillar-box i {
        display: block;
        font-size: 22px;
        margin-bottom: 8px;
        color: var(--primary);
    }

    .divider {
        height: 1px;
        background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15), transparent);
        margin: 26px 0;
    }

    .section-title {
        font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;
        font-size: 16px;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
        letter-spacing: 1.5px;
        color: #fff;
        text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .steps-container {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 8px;
        text-align: left;
    }

    .step-item {
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
        padding: 16px;
        border-radius: 16px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 14px;
        font-size: 14px;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #cbd5e1;
    }

    .step-number {
        background: var(--primary);
        color: #000;
        font-weight: 900;
        width: 30px;
        height: 30px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        font-size: 13px;
        flex-shrink: 0;
        box-shadow: 0 0 12px var(--primary-glow);
    }

    .step-arrow {
        color: var(--primary);
        font-size: 14px;
        margin: 4px 0;
        opacity: 0.85;
        text-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--primary-glow);
    }

    .step-item.highlight-step {
        background: rgba(0, 255, 136, 0.08);
        border-color: var(--success);
        color: #fff;
    }

    .step-item.highlight-step .step-number {
        background: var(--success);
        box-shadow: 0 0 12px var(--success-glow);
    }

    /* --- NOVO: ESTILOS DO CARROSSEL DE FOTOS --- */
    .carousel-container {
        position: relative;
        width: 100%;
        border-radius: 20px;
        border: 1px solid var(--primary);
        background: #000;
        overflow: hidden;
        margin-bottom: 24px;
        box-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(0, 194, 255, 0.2);
    }

    .carousel-track {
        display: flex;
        transition: transform 0.4s ease-in-out;
        width: 100%;
    }

    .carousel-slide {
        min-width: 100%;
        box-sizing: border-box;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
        align-items: center;
    }

    .carousel-slide img {
        width: 100%;
        height: auto;
        max-height: 400px;
        object-fit: contain;
        display: block;
    }

    .carousel-btn {
        position: absolute;
        top: 50%;
        transform: translateY(-50%);
        background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);
        color: var(--primary);
        border: 1px solid var(--primary);
        width: 38px;
        height: 38px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        cursor: pointer;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        font-size: 16px;
        z-index: 10;
        transition: 0.3s;
    }

    .carousel-btn:hover {
        background: var(--primary);
        color: #000;
        box-shadow: 0 0 12px var(--primary-glow);
    }

    .carousel-btn.prev { left: 10px; }
    .carousel-btn.next { right: 10px; }

    .carousel-dots {
        position: absolute;
        bottom: 10px;
        left: 50%;
        transform: translateX(-50%);
        display: flex;
        gap: 8px;
        z-index: 10;
    }

    .dot {
        width: 8px;
        height: 8px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: 0.3s;
    }

    .dot.active {
        background: var(--primary);
        box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--primary-glow);
        width: 20px;
        border-radius: 10px;
    }

    /* --- FORMULÁRIO DE CAPTURA --- */
    .lead-form-box {
        background: rgba(0, 255, 136, 0.03);
        border: 2px solid var(--success);
        border-radius: 24px;
        padding: 24px 18px;
        box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(0, 255, 136, 0.15);
        margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .form-title {
        font-size: 18px;
        font-weight: 800;
        color: #fff;
        margin-bottom: 8px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .form-subtitle {
        font-size: 13px;
        color: #cbd5e1;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
        line-height: 1.4;
    }

    .form-subtitle strong {
        color: var(--success);
    }

    .custom-form {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 12px;
    }

    .form-input {
        width: 100%;
        padding: 16px;
        border-radius: 14px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
        background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
        color: #fff;
        font-size: 15px;
        outline: none;
        transition: 0.3s;
    }

    .form-input:focus {
        border-color: var(--success);
        box-shadow: 0 0 12px var(--success-glow);
    }

    .btn-cta-green {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 10px;
        width: 100%;
        padding: 18px;
        border-radius: 14px;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-weight: 900;
        font-size: 15px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        background: linear-gradient(180deg, #00ff88 0%, #00b862 100%);
        color: #000;
        box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 255, 136, 0.35);
        transition: 0.3s ease;
        border: none;
        cursor: pointer;
        animation: btnGreenGlow 2s infinite alternate;
        margin-top: 6px;
    }

    @keyframes btnGreenGlow {
        0% { transform: translateY(0); box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0, 255, 136, 0.3); }
        100% { transform: translateY(-3px); box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(0, 255, 136, 0.6); }
    }

    .btn-cta-green:hover {
        filter: brightness(1.15);
    }

    .btn-cta-green i {
        font-size: 20px;
    }

    .btn-subtext {
        display: block;
        font-size: 12px;
        color: var(--success);
        margin-top: 14px;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    }

    .benefits-box {
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
        border-radius: 20px;
        padding: 20px;
        text-align: left;
    }

    .benefit-item {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 12px;
        color: #e2e8f0;
        font-size: 14px;
        font-weight: 700;
        margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    .benefit-item:last-child {
        margin-bottom: 0;
    }

    .benefit-item i {
        color: var(--success);
        font-size: 16px;
    }

    .faq-container {
        text-align: left;
    }

    .faq-item {
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
        border-radius: 16px;
        padding: 16px;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
        transition: 0.3s;
    }

    .faq-item:hover {
        border-color: rgba(0, 194, 255, 0.4);
    }

    .faq-question {
        font-weight: 800;
        font-size: 14px;
        color: #fff;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
    }

    .faq-question i {
        color: var(--primary);
    }

    .faq-answer {
        font-size: 13px;
        color: #94a3b8;
        line-height: 1.6;
        margin-top: 10px;
    }

    .footer {
        margin-top: 28px;
        font-size: 11px;
        color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
        .container { padding: 16px 10px 30px; }
        .main-card { padding: 24px 14px; }
        .logo { font-size: 34px; }
        .btn-cta-green { font-size: 14px; padding: 16px 10px; }
    }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">
    <div class="main-card">
        
        <!-- CABEÇALHO -->
        <div class="logo">MÉTODO <span>PRIME</span></div>
        
        <div class="tagline-group">
            <div class="tagline-main">Aprenda Grátis. Lucre Primeiro.</div>
            <div class="highlight-gold">⚡ PAGUE DEPOIS</div>
        </div>

        <div class="no-pay-badge">
            <i class="fas fa-shield-alt"></i> 100% Sem pagamento antecipado
        </div>

        <!-- PILARES -->
        <div class="grid-pillars">
            <div class="pillar-box">
                <i class="fas fa-gift"></i>
                Comece Grátis
            </div>
            <div class="pillar-box">
                <i class="fas fa-chart-line"></i>
                Lucre Primeiro
            </div>
            <div class="pillar-box">
                <i class="fas fa-handshake"></i>
                Pague Depois
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="divider"></div>

        <!-- COMO FUNCIONA -->
        <div class="section-title">COMO FUNCIONA</div>

        <div class="steps-container">
            <div class="step-item">
                <span class="step-number">1</span>
                <span>Aprende gratuitamente</span>
            </div>
            
            <div style="text-align: center;"><i class="fas fa-chevron-down step-arrow"></i></div>

            <div class="step-item">
                <span class="step-number">2</span>
                <span>Faz tudo na sua conta</span>
            </div>

            <div style="text-align: center;"><i class="fas fa-chevron-down step-arrow"></i></div>

            <div class="step-item">
                <span class="step-number">3</span>
                <span>Obtém lucro</span>
            </div>

            <div style="text-align: center;"><i class="fas fa-chevron-down step-arrow"></i></div>

            <div class="step-item highlight-step">
                <span class="step-number">4</span>
                <span>Compartilha apenas parte do primeiro lucro</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="divider"></div>

        <!-- CARROSSEL DE FOTOS / RESULTADOS -->
        <div class="carousel-container">
            <button class="carousel-btn prev" onclick="moveSlide(-1)"><i class="fas fa-chevron-left"></i></button>
            <button class="carousel-btn next" onclick="moveSlide(1)"><i class="fas fa-chevron-right"></i></button>
            
            <div class="carousel-track" id="carouselTrack">
                <!-- Substitua 'foto1.jpg', 'foto2.jpg', etc., pelos caminhos/links das suas imagens -->
                <div class="carousel-slide"><img src="foto1.jpeg" alt="Resultado 1"></div>
                <div class="carousel-slide"><img src="foto2.jpeg" alt="Resultado 2"></div>
                <div class="carousel-slide"><img src="foto3.jpeg" alt="Resultado 3"></div>
            </div>

            <div class="carousel-dots">
                <span class="dot active" onclick="currentSlide(0)"></span>
                <span class="dot" onclick="currentSlide(1)"></span>
                <span class="dot" onclick="currentSlide(2)"></span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- FORMULÁRIO DE CAPTURA DE WHATSAPP -->
        <div class="lead-form-box">
            <div class="form-title">💬 RECEBA SEU ACESSO VIP</div>
            <p class="form-subtitle">
                Preencha os dados abaixo e <strong>nossa equipe vai chamar você diretamente no WhatsApp</strong> para liberar seu acesso!
            </p>

            <!-- IMPORTANTE: Troque 'SEUEMAIL@EXEMPLO.COM' pelo e-mail onde quer receber os contatos -->
            <form action="https://formsubmit.co/vinnydaigreja421@gmail.com" method="POST" class="custom-form">
                <input type="hidden" name="_captcha" value="false">

                <input type="text" name="Nome" class="form-input" placeholder="Digite seu primeiro nome" required>
                <input type="tel" name="WhatsApp" class="form-input" placeholder="Seu WhatsApp com DDD (ex: 11999999999)" required>

                <button type="submit" class="btn-cta-green">
                    <i class="fab fa-whatsapp"></i> QUERO QUE ME CHAMEM NO WHATSAPP
                </button>
            </form>

            <span class="btn-subtext">
                👉 Preencha com atenção! Chamamos em poucos minutos.
            </span>
        </div>

        <div class="divider"></div>

        <!-- POR QUE CONFIAR? -->
        <div class="section-title">POR QUE CONFIAR?</div>

        <div class="benefits-box">
            <div class="benefit-item"><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> Não cobramos nada antecipadamente</div>
            <div class="benefit-item"><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> Risco Zero: Você só paga depois de lucrar</div>
            <div class="benefit-item"><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> Suporte individual e acompanhamento</div>
            <div class="benefit-item"><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> Método atualizado e testado</div>
        </div>

        <div class="divider"></div>

        <!-- PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES -->
        <div class="section-title">PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES</div>

        <div class="faq-container">
            <div class="faq-item">
                <div class="faq-question">
                    <span>Preciso pagar algo antes de começar?</span>
                    <i class="fas fa-question-circle"></i>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-answer">
                    Não! O acesso a todo o conteúdo é 100% gratuito. Você não coloca o seu cartão e nem faz nenhum PIX antecipado.
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="faq-item">
                <div class="faq-question">
                    <span>Quando e como eu realizo o pagamento?</span>
                    <i class="fas fa-question-circle"></i>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-answer">
                    Você só compartilha a nossa porcentagem depois que o dinheiro já estiver no seu bolso/conta após o seu primeiro lucro.
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- RODAPÉ -->
        <div class="footer">
            <p>&copy; Método Prime. Todos os direitos reservados.</p>
        </div>

    </div>
</div>

<!-- SCRIPT DO CARROSSEL DE FOTOS -->
<script>
    let currentIdx = 0;
    const track = id => document.getElementById(id);

    function updateCarousel() {
        const slides = document.querySelectorAll('.carousel-slide');
        const dots = document.querySelectorAll('.dot');
        
        if (currentIdx >= slides.length) currentIdx = 0;
        if (currentIdx < 0) currentIdx = slides.length - 1;

        track('carouselTrack').style.transform = `translateX(-${currentIdx * 100}%)`;

        dots.forEach((dot, index) => {
            dot.classList.toggle('active', index === currentIdx);
        });
    }

    function moveSlide(direction) {
        currentIdx += direction;
        updateCarousel();
    }

    function currentSlide(index) {
        currentIdx = index;
        updateCarousel();
    }

    // Troca de foto automaticamente a cada 4 segundos
    setInterval(() => {
        moveSlide(1);
    }, 4000);
</script>

</body>
</html>
